36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:53,210 --> 00:01:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where...?</font>

38
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where... am I?</font>

39
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:52,610
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shock, the Closed Door</font>

40
00:02:57,110 --> 00:03:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'm up for it today again!</font>

41
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:08,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, there haven't been
any flashy missions around here lately.</font>

42
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! It's unbelievable, right?!</font>

43
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, well...</font>

44
00:03:17,210 --> 00:03:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lately, I'm dead tired
from doing nothing but training.</font>

45
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

46
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

47
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's someone who's got
too much time on his hands!</font>

48
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?! Speak for yourself.</font>

49
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:28,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how I look at it,
you are just helping the shop.</font>

50
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened
to Shikamaru and Choji?</font>

51
00:03:30,850 --> 00:03:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On a mission with Asuma-sensei!</font>

52
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I wanted to go on a mission, too!</font>

53
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While Ino was down with a cold,
everyone went on urgent missions.</font>

54
00:03:42,110 --> 00:03:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now I'm completely recovered!</font>

55
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I going to do
with all my fighting spirit?</font>

56
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you use that fighting spirit
in some training?</font>

57
00:03:49,790 --> 00:03:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you think!</font>

58
00:03:51,710 --> 00:03:53,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my family, if you don't have
a training partner,</font>

59
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then they make up some reason
for you to help out with the shop!</font>

60
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They must know that if you're alone,
you'll skip training, eh?</font>

61
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Don't say something
that could hurt a person's reputation!</font>

62
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:06,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do it properly by myself.</font>

63
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:08,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

64
00:04:09,890 --> 00:04:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Shino! Don't surprise me!</font>

65
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto, Yamanaka Ino.</font>

66
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:17,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage is asking
for both of you.</font>

67
00:04:18,270 --> 00:04:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Me, too?</font>

68
00:04:20,490 --> 00:04:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, I've also been ordered
to go along with you guys.</font>

69
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino, me and Shino?</font>

70
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon of Ocean causing disturbance...?</font>

71
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, literally a demon in the ocean.</font>

72
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to be causing the disturbance
happening in the remote Land of Sea.</font>

73
00:04:44,130 --> 00:04:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

74
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll go for me, won't you?</font>

75
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course.</font>

76
00:04:54,850 --> 00:04:56,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Shizune.
— Yes!</font>

77
00:04:57,150 --> 00:04:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Explain.
— Yes!</font>

78
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you can see,</font>

79
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Land of Sea is made up
of a group of islands of various sizes.</font>

80
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:09,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recently in that area, their only means
of transportation, ships,</font>

81
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are being attacked and robbed
of money and valuables.</font>

82
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people on the boat
who were victimized</font>

83
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unanimously claim that the damage
was done by the "Demon of the Ocean."</font>

84
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:24,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And exterminating this Demon
of the Ocean is the mission?</font>

85
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:28,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, more or less, yes.
But there's more.</font>

86
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Sea does not have
a hidden village of its own,</font>

87
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:32,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so they're prepared for contingencies</font>

88
00:05:32,770 --> 00:05:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">through military cooperation
with the neighbouring Land of Water,</font>

89
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have been paying them
a retainer every month.</font>

90
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the other day,
one of their ships that collects funds</font>

91
00:05:40,770 --> 00:05:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was attacked
by the Demon of the Ocean as well.</font>

92
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. To preserve their relationship
with Land of Water,</font>

93
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Land of Sea will do anything
to protect the next ship.</font>

94
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. This mission is to guard
the ships collecting funds</font>

95
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and destroy the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

96
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got a few people to work under you,
so I'm counting on you.</font>

97
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Work under me?</font>

98
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:03,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enter!</font>

99
00:06:10,140 --> 00:06:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam's...</font>

100
00:06:12,470 --> 00:06:15,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That scary proctor!</font>

101
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you're bringing back memories..!</font>

102
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mitarashi Anko-sensei?</font>

103
00:06:23,270 --> 00:06:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you here?</font>

104
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:26,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Everyone!
— Yes!</font>

105
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm pronouncing your mission!</font>

106
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:29,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aburame Shino! Yamanaka Ino!</font>

107
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:31,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

108
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of you will work under Anko
and accompany her on a mission!</font>

109
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! These members?</font>

110
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The team is pretty disjointed, isn't it?!</font>

111
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No use talking about it!</font>

112
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, I've thought the matter through</font>

113
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I believe that this combination is</font>

114
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the most qualified for this mission.</font>

115
00:06:51,470 --> 00:06:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Display your own capabilities to the
fullest extent and execute this mission!</font>

116
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

117
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She just gathered the available Genin.
Really, she is such a...</font>

118
00:07:04,730 --> 00:07:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, something doesn't feel
quite right...</font>

119
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah, no complaints
about a mission that's settled!</font>

120
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch! I got it!</font>

121
00:07:13,370 --> 00:07:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, we'll depart right away!</font>

122
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:18,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone prepare and assemble
at the front gate!</font>

123
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:19,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Roger!
— Roger!</font>

124
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, ouch.</font>

125
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko.</font>

126
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful.</font>

127
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

128
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Characteristics
of the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

129
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like a fish, like a person..."
What is this?!</font>

130
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, someone's eyes are playing tricks.
Something like that can't exist!</font>

131
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not true, it's possible
that Ex-Ninja become pirates</font>

132
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and use Transformation and Genjutsu.</font>

133
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, whatever, if we don't gather
information, there will be no solution.</font>

134
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

135
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother Island is the biggest island
at the center of Land of Sea.</font>

136
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll go to a nearby fishing port
and cross over by boat!</font>

137
00:08:13,470 --> 00:08:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand!</font>

138
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Let's depart for the Land of Sea!</font>

139
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:22,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy is always hyper.</font>

140
00:08:22,310 --> 00:08:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm anxious about what's going to happen.</font>

141
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are.</font>

142
00:08:32,570 --> 00:08:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... Tsunade-sama.</font>

143
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about Mitarashi Anko just now.</font>

144
00:08:41,330 --> 00:08:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did...?
Did something happen in the past?</font>

145
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:51,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sort of.</font>

146
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

147
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her record of missions from about
the age of 10 is pretty sporadic.</font>

148
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because Anko was under Orochimaru.</font>

149
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the parts that are blacked out</font>

150
00:09:13,570 --> 00:09:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are combined
with Orochimaru's movements...</font>

151
00:09:15,650 --> 00:09:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and in the confidential file?</font>

152
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Part of them are.</font>

153
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:23,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are some parts
that aren't recorded.</font>

154
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the truth.</font>

155
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:28,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No record?! Even though
Anko herself was in the village?</font>

156
00:09:32,090 --> 00:09:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru...</font>

157
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he really didn't want
to be traced.</font>

158
00:09:38,050 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he left the village,</font>

159
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he erased part of Anko's memories.</font>

160
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wind is salty.</font>

161
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Coming this far, we can already see
over the Land of Sea.</font>

162
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:53,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, that must be the Mother Island?</font>

163
00:10:29,060 --> 00:10:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? What is this feeling?</font>

164
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone... Sorry, but...</font>

165
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go ahead and take care
of the arrangements for the boat.</font>

166
00:10:44,330 --> 00:10:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? But what would you do, Sensei?</font>

167
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of some business
and join you. See you!</font>

168
00:10:50,710 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sensei?!</font>

169
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, it can't be helped.</font>

170
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, Shino?</font>

171
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll leave you behind!</font>

172
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

173
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark aches.</font>

174
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This presence... No question about it.</font>

175
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way?</font>

176
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can say their names
without a problem!</font>

177
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... That's Mother Island.</font>

178
00:11:42,470 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are Taro Island and Jiro island.</font>

179
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... that there's Demon Island!</font>

180
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems you prepared before you came.</font>

181
00:11:53,230 --> 00:11:58,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to become a wiser, stronger
Shinobi like you, Orochimaru-sama.</font>

182
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...?</font>

183
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

184
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but I can't give you anything
more than this.</font>

185
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up, Ino?</font>

186
00:12:23,010 --> 00:12:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, mister!</font>

187
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you bringing prices down
way too much?</font>

188
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's high-quality fish, isn't it?</font>

189
00:12:28,810 --> 00:12:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, dear.</font>

190
00:12:30,430 --> 00:12:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not price-cutting.</font>

191
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, because of that
"Demon of the Ocean" uproar,</font>

192
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">customers are completely staying away.</font>

193
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:41,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the market price around here.</font>

194
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? That fish is rarely...</font>

195
00:12:46,450 --> 00:12:50,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with her appearance?
Is she injured or something?</font>

196
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. That girl, she has her reasons.</font>

197
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

198
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she's a female diver from a small town
on the cape of Mother Island.</font>

199
00:12:58,750 --> 00:12:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

200
00:13:00,590 --> 00:13:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would a woman diver on
Mother Island transfer islands on purpose?</font>

201
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because the island people
didn't want to do business with her.</font>

202
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That girl,</font>

203
00:13:11,470 --> 00:13:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the past, she was spirited away.</font>

204
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:15,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Spirited away"?</font>

205
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:18,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person suddenly disappears.
Is that it?</font>

206
00:13:18,770 --> 00:13:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

207
00:13:19,900 --> 00:13:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the past,</font>

208
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a lot of island people disappeared
from being spirited away.</font>

209
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The story is that out of all those people</font>

210
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that girl was the only one
who suddenly returned one day.</font>

211
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey!</font>

212
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a little village,</font>

213
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so everyone felt creepy.</font>

214
00:13:40,710 --> 00:13:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They say that now she lives alone
outside of the village.</font>

215
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. I feel sorry for her.</font>

216
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With her appearance...
And then you hear things, I, too...</font>

217
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">feel a little bit creepy.</font>

218
00:13:56,190 --> 00:13:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true.</font>

219
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, where's Naruto?</font>

220
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

221
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! What are you guys doing?!</font>

222
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

223
00:14:34,470 --> 00:14:37,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, are you okay?
— Yes.</font>

224
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... You're from a place
called Mother Island, aren't you?</font>

225
00:14:46,190 --> 00:14:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing.</font>

226
00:14:49,780 --> 00:14:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja.</font>

227
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'll help!</font>

228
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's okay.</font>

229
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Hey, wait.</font>

230
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

231
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:07,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad, but the last boat
from the port has already left.</font>

232
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the sun hasn't even set yet.</font>

233
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:14,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Around here, there's nobody who will
take you across in the early evening.</font>

234
00:15:14,850 --> 00:15:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but come back tomorrow.</font>

235
00:15:17,850 --> 00:15:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

236
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:22,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, is there a way to get
to Mother Island besides the ferry?</font>

237
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't really advise it, but...</font>

238
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's necessary,
I'll let you borrow my little boat.</font>

239
00:15:34,780 --> 00:15:37,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I was looking all over for you guys!</font>

240
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! Where were you?!</font>

241
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, sorry.</font>

242
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should at least say something
before you disappear.</font>

243
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and Sensei are exactly alike,
suddenly going someplace.</font>

244
00:15:52,890 --> 00:15:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Feels like there'll be
a bumpy road ahead.</font>

245
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! That's rude.</font>

246
00:15:56,680 --> 00:16:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Placing me in the same category together
with that unreasonable sensei...!</font>

247
00:16:00,310 --> 00:16:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Who's what?
— Sorry.</font>

248
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This sensei is dangerous, after all.</font>

249
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work procuring the boat!</font>

250
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, where in the world
have you been all this time?</font>

251
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, something like gathering information.</font>

252
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's go!</font>

253
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shinobi of Leaf Village are here.</font>

254
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Land of Sea must have pleaded with them</font>

255
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to investigate
on the "Demon of the Ocean."</font>

256
00:16:24,790 --> 00:16:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, we should give them
the best welcome.</font>

257
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's getting dark.</font>

258
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're almost to Mother Island.</font>

259
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, all right!</font>

260
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Full-speed advance to Mother Island!</font>

261
00:16:40,310 --> 00:16:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although the sun has already set...</font>

262
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where does all
your hyper-energy come from?!</font>

263
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Times like this,
your state of mind is important!</font>

264
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura sure has her share of trouble.
I feel sorry for her.</font>

265
00:16:57,870 --> 00:17:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?
I ran up against a rock or something!</font>

266
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Naruto!</font>

267
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:04,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, all of you look forward, front!</font>

268
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dodge it, quick!</font>

269
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say that, but...</font>

270
00:17:09,170 --> 00:17:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good, the oar won't move!</font>

271
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll help!</font>

272
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...! Striking Shadow Snake!</font>

273
00:17:22,310 --> 00:17:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Leave it!</font>

274
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand!</font>

275
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To show themself so soon...</font>

276
00:17:34,530 --> 00:17:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close.</font>

277
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The two of you be careful!
He's aiming at us from underwater!</font>

278
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

279
00:17:42,740 --> 00:17:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon of the Ocean or whatever,</font>

280
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an underwater creature
for an underwater battle!</font>

281
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

282
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:51,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Chief Toad!</font>

283
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

284
00:17:56,010 --> 00:17:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Naruto!
What kind of place did you call me to?!</font>

285
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you come out?!
You stupid frog!</font>

286
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Hey, wait!</font>

287
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:05,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu.</font>

288
00:18:06,230 --> 00:18:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come out, Chief Toad!</font>

289
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, good evening!</font>

290
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!
I've been calling for Chief Toad!</font>

291
00:18:13,730 --> 00:18:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid! If you summoned
the old man to a place like this,</font>

292
00:18:16,610 --> 00:18:18,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">terrible things would happen.</font>

293
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Why?</font>

294
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're freshwater creatures!
We don't go with saltwater!</font>

295
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't like salty things either.</font>

296
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're no help at all!</font>

297
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:33,170
